X:1
T:Quartet in D
C:Andante for string quartet
%%accompany off
M:3/4
L:1/8
Q:1/4=80
K:D
V:1 name="Solo Violin I"
V:2 name="Solo Violin II"
V:3 name="Solo Viola"
V:4 name="Solo Cello"
% bars 1-4: the theme in the first violin; the viola rocks across its strings, the cello plucks the bass
[V:1] "D"!mf! (f3 g a2) | "G"(b4 "D/F#"a2) | "Em"(g3 f "A7"e2) | "Asus4"(d2 "A"c4) |
[V:2] !p! A6 | d6 | (B4 c2) | A6 |
[V:3] !p! (D A, F A,) (D A,) | (G, D B, D) (A, D) | (G, B, E B,) (A, C) | (A, E A, E) (C E) |
[V:4] "^pizz."!mp! D,2 z2 A,,2 | G,,2 z2 F,,2 | E,,2 z2 A,,2 | A,,2 z2 C,2 |
% bars 5-8: the answer reaches a sixth higher and closes on the tonic, with a cadential trill
[V:1] "D"!<(! (f3 g a2) | "Bm"!<)! !f! (d'3 c' !>(! b2) | "D/A"(a3 g "A7"!trill!e2) | "D"!>)! !mf! d4 z2 |
[V:2] !<(! d6 | !<)! !mp! (f3 e !>(! d2) | (f3 e c2) | !>)! !p! A4 z2 |
[V:3] !<(! (D A, F A,) (D A,) | !<)! !mp! (B, D F D) !>(! (B, D) | (A, D F D) (A, C) | !>)! !p! (D A, F A,) D2 |
[V:4] !<(! D,2 z2 A,,2 | !<)! !mf! B,,2 z2 !>(! F,,2 | A,,2 z2 A,,2 | !>)! !mp! D,,2 z4 |
% bars 9-12: B minor; the cello sings on its A string, the viola holds the bass, the violins breathe off the beat
[V:1] "Bm"!p! z f z f z f | "Em"z g z g z g | "F#7"z e z e z e | "Bm"z f z f z2 |
[V:2] !p! z d z d z d | z e z e z e | z c z c z c | z d z d z2 |
[V:3] !p! B,6 | G,6 | F,6 | D,6 |
[V:4] "^arco"!mf! (D3 E F2) | (G3 F E2) | (^A,3 B, C2) | B,6 |
% bars 13-16: the first violin takes the line and climbs to the climax over a dominant pedal
[V:1] "G"!mp! !<(! (B3 c d2) | "A7"(e3 f g2) | "D/A"!<)! !f! a2 d'2 f'2 | "A7"!>(! (e'3 c' a g) |
[V:2] !p! !<(! G6 | !//!c6 | !<)! !mf! !//!d6 | !>(! c6 |
[V:3] !p! !<(! D6 | !//!G6 | !<)! !mf! !//!F6 | !>(! E6 |
[V:4] !p! !<(! G,,6 | A,,2 A,,2 A,,2 | !<)! !mf! A,,2 A,,2 A,,2 | !>(! A,,6 |
% bars 17-20: the theme returns, the second violin in thirds beneath it, the viola with a counter-line
[V:1] "D"!>)! !mf! (f3 g a2) | "G"(b4 "D/F#"a2) | "Em"(g3 f "A7"e2) | "Asus4"(d2 "A"c4) |
[V:2] !>)! !p! (d3 e f2) | (g4 d2) | (e3 d c2) | A6 |
[V:3] !>)! !p! A,2 D2 F2 | (G4 A2) | G6 | E6 |
[V:4] !>)! !p! D,6 | G,,4 F,,2 | E,,4 A,,2 | A,,6 |
% bars 21-23: the answer again, swelling to the cadence and its trill
[V:1] "D"(f3 g a2) | "Bm"!<(! (d'3 c' b2) | "D/A"!<)! !f! (a3 g !>(! "A7"!trill!e2) |
[V:2] (d3 e f2) | !<(! (f3 e d2) | !<)! !mp! (f3 e !>(! c2) |
[V:3] (F4 A2) | !<(! (D4 F2) | !<)! !mp! (A4 !>(! G2) |
[V:4] D,4 C,2 | !<(! B,,6 | !<)! !mp! A,,4 !>(! A,,2 |
% bars 24-26: a deceptive cadence, then G, G minor and home, slowing
[V:1] "Bm""^rit."!>)! !p! d4 c2 | "G"!>(! B4 "Gm"_B2 | "D"!>)! !pp! !fermata!A6 |]
[V:2] !>)! !pp! B6 | G6 | !fermata!F6 |]
[V:3] !>)! !pp! F6 | D6 | !fermata!D6 |]
[V:4] !>)! !pp! B,,6 | G,,6 | !fermata!D,,6 |]
